hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2898","Muhammad bin Isa narrated to us, Salamah narrated to us. Muhammad said: And Abdullah bin Abi Najih narrated to me, on the authority of Mujahid, on the authority of Ibn Abbas (RA), who said: \The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ)"","" in the year of Al-Hudaybiyyah"","" sent a camel among his gifts to Abu Jahl"","" with a silver hump (or a silver ornament on its head)"","" in order to provoke and anger the polytheists with that.\"""""""
